  "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_record/v4",
  "task_id": "close-taskrecord-v3-drain-window",
  "intent_snapshot": {
    "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_intent/v1",
    "task_id": "close-taskrecord-v3-drain-window",
    "goal": "Narrow the live TaskRecord union from TaskRecordV3 | TaskRecordV4 to TaskRecordV4 alone, rejecting a v3-contract record at every live reducer/coordinator entry point instead of letting it progress to completion, while extracting TaskRecordV2/TaskRecordV3 and their frozen parsers into a dedicated historical-only module that readAuditTaskPair keeps using to read existing .imm/audit/ v2 and v3 terminal records unchanged.",
    "acceptance": [
      {
        "id": "AC1",
        "assertion": "A v3-contract TaskRecord fed through the live reducer (reduceTask) is rejected instead of progressing its lifecycle to done; the existing test's core assertion is rewritten to prove rejection, not deleted.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.4.2\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/kernel-assurance-obligation.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 60000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 65536\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC2",
        "assertion": "The dual-host conformance test's v3 case is rewritten (title and body) so a v3-contract record fails closed through coordinator.advance()/submitReview() for both the Claude and Pi host adapters, identically to how vFuture, stale identity, and concurrent continuation already fail closed in the same test.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.4.2\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/dual-host-assurance-conformance.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 120000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 131072\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC3",
        "assertion": "readAuditTaskPair and its callers continue reading existing .imm/audit/ v2 and v3 terminal records unchanged through the relocated frozen historical reader module.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.4.2\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/kernel-storage-layout-migration.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/task-record-durability.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 120000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 131072\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC4",
        "assertion": "v4-only live-path reducer and risk-downgrade-guard behavior is unaffected by the narrowing, and the frozen parseTaskRecordV3/parseTaskRecordV2 parser-level tests keep passing from their new historical-only module location.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.4.2\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/kernel-r2c2-reducer.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/risk-downgrade-guard.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-record-v3.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-record-v4.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 120000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 131072\n}\n"
      }
    ],
